@startuml Activity Diagram - Start New Conversation

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam activityPadding 6
skinparam activityMargin 6
skinparam arrowThickness 1
skinparam notePadding 4
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

|Customer|
start

|Customer|
:(1) Open chat widget / click "Start conversation";
|System|
:(2) Authenticate (if required) and request new conversation (API);
:(3) Create conversation record;

|Database|
:(4) Persist conversation;

|System|
:(5) Return conversation id and initial state; display greeting;

|Customer|
:(6) Begin typing or select suggested question;
stop

@enduml